OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 26 JAN
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings including a live
OL,8,     Gconcert from Wigmore Hall with
OL,9,     Gcellist Alisa Weilerstein and
OL,10,     Gpianist Pavel Kolesnikov.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Franz Xaver
OL,12,     FWolfgang Mozart
OL,13,     GDonald Macleod takes a tour of
OL,14,     Gthe early life of Franz Xaver
OL,15,     GMozart, including the complicated
OL,16,     Grelationship with his mother,
OL,17,     GConstanze.
OL,18,G1700FIn Tune
OL,19,     GLive music from the Piatti
OL,20,     GQuartet.
