OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 26 JAN
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,8,     GThe Ukranian pianist Vadym
OL,9,     GKholodenko performs works by
OL,10,     GBeethoven, Lyatoshinsky, and
OL,11,     GLiszt in concert at Wigmore Hall
OL,12,     Gin London.
OL,13,G2145FThe Essay: On Disappointment
OL,14,     GRachel Cooke looks at the
OL,15,     Gdisappointments of the creative
OL,16,     Glife. Creative disappointment,
OL,17,     Gwhich often follows years of
OL,18,     Gsolitary work, is, she feels, one
OL,19,     Gof the worst kinds.
