OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 26 JAN
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GThe in-demand rising UK trumpeter
OL,12,     GPoppy Daniels is Soweto's guest
OL,13,     Gall this week.
OL,14,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,15,     GThe WDR Symphony Orchestra,
OL,16,     GCologne performs Bruckner's
OL,17,     GEighth Symphony that the composer
OL,18,     Ghimself described as a 'mystery'.
